{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10419","headline":"宋中遇刘书记有别 · 高适","name":"宋中遇刘书记有别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何代无秀士，高门生此才。\n森然覩毛发，若见河山来。\n几载困常调，一朝时运催。\n白身谒明主，待诏登云台。\n相逢梁宋间，与我醉蒿莱。\n寒楚眇千里，雪天昼不开。\n末路终离别，不能强悲哀。\n男儿争富贵，劝尔莫迟廻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}